t\", \"q\": \"For each cause of death, alcohol-attributable fractions were used, reflecting the cause-specific proportion that is due to excessive alcohol use.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"population-attributable fractions were estimated using relative risks from published meta-analyses and adjusted prevalence estimates\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"adjusted using alcohol per capita sales information to account for underreporting of self-reported drinking\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Death rates (deaths per 100,000 population) were calculated based on midyear postcensal population estimates\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Nonoverlapping 95% CIs were considered significantly different.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}